true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":5,"text":"After the first five laps the Bugattis of Varzi and Chiron were leading.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":8,"text":"Chiron stops for three minutes with ignition trouble; Fagioli inherits second.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":9,"text":"On lap nine von Morgen stopped his big Bugatti at his pits to change both left tires, which were flat-spotted by locking brakes on his new car.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":9,"text":"Varzi in the meantime carried on without disturbance and drove his ninth lap in 5m04s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":10,"text":"The order was Varzi, Fagioli, Dreyfus and Lehoux, who had already fallen back, followed by Etancelin and Siena.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":10,"text":"The only German, von Morgen, retired his 5-liter Bugatti after 10 laps with a broken right rear brake shoe and left tire worn due to a locked brake.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":18},{"lap":14,"text":"On lap 14 Dreyfus had to stop at the pits to change plugs.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":15,"text":"Joly leads the 1500 class from Castelbarco and Veyron.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":17,"text":"On lap 17, as Fagioli moved just a few seconds closer to Varzi, he encountered supercharger problems and was stranded on the circuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":17,"text":"With Fagioli out and Dreyfus in the pits changing spark plugs, Lehoux was once again in second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":17,"text":"Wimille retires from fourth with an overheated engine and brake problems.","q":false,"c":17},{"lap":17,"text":"Gallay retired his 1500 Bugatti on the same lap with overheating problems.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":19},{"lap":21,"text":"In the 1500 class, Castelbarco (Bugatti) passed Joly (Maserati) but then the Bugatti headed for the pits .","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":25,"text":"After 25 laps Varzi had increased his advantage by a great margin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"Chiron laps in 5m03s, 151 km/h.","q":false,"c":5},{"lap":31,"text":"On lap 31 Joly set the lap record for the 1500 class at 5m35s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":34,"text":"Veyron passes Castelbarco, who is in the pits changing plugs.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":35,"text":"Lehoux fought desperately and established the record by taking fuel in only 25 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":37,"text":"To the cheers from the grandstand crowd, Varzi crossed the finish line in first place. He only had to stop once to refuel in 50 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":37,"text":"Lehoux followed around three minutes later but his brakes had faded. Third placed Etancelin arrived over four minutes after the winner.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":37,"text":"Joly (Maserati) finished in ninth place, followed by Veyron (Maserati), Count Luigi Castelbarco (Bugatti) and Scaron (Amilcar).","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8}]}